            "detailed_description": "Freedom of movement with flight, touch pad, and teleportation!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove through the city hunting down your enemies with a growing assortment of weapons from home-made spears to assault rifles!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSneak up on armed targets to catch them off guard!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOr maneuver at full speed around bullets and bat their head off into the distance!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you take back control of the city from the terrorist and infected?<br />\r\n <br />\r\nHelp shape the game and give us feedback as we work to make the game just how you want it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe encourage you to read our early access plans before purchasing!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs development continues, more scenarios, features, and content will be added including a more in-depth rts mode and active cities!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nALL customer feedback gets taken into account in decision making, so we can promise you that you will be heard!",
            "about_the_game": "Freedom of movement with flight, touch pad, and teleportation!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove through the city hunting down your enemies with a growing assortment of weapons from home-made spears to assault rifles!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSneak up on armed targets to catch them off guard!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOr maneuver at full speed around bullets and bat their head off into the distance!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you take back control of the city from the terrorist and infected?<br />\r\n <br />\r\nHelp shape the game and give us feedback as we work to make the game just how you want it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe encourage you to read our early access plans before purchasing!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs development continues, more scenarios, features, and content will be added including a more in-depth rts mode and active cities!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nALL customer feedback gets taken into account in decision making, so we can promise you that you will be heard!",
